# The local scaffold runs with no environment at all: `pnpm dev`, `pnpm build`
# and every check work without AWS credentials or any API key.
#
# Variables land here when the code actually reads them — AWS region and the
# S3 bucket with the deployment step, the model endpoint with the chat. Client
# variables must be prefixed `VITE_`; anything without that prefix stays on the
# server and must never be imported from browser code.
